<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>adhan-mute</title>
		<meta name="description" content="A small cross-platform CLI that mutes system audio at each prayer time, based on your location." />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="scanlines"></div>
		<div class="vignette"></div>

		<header>
			<div class="wrap">
				<div class="brand">
					<span class="crescent">☾</span><span class="prompt">~/</span>adhan-mute<span class="cursor">_</span>
				</div>
				<a class="gh-link" href="https://github.com/wailbentafat/adhan-mute">[ github ]</a>
			</div>
		</header>

		<main>
			<section class="hero">
				<div class="wrap hero-inner">
					<pre class="ascii" aria-hidden="true">   ▄▄   ▄▄▄▄   ▄    ▄   ▄▄   ▄▄   ▄        ▄    ▄ ▄    ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄ ▄▄▄▄▄▄
   ██   █   ▀▄ █    █   ██   █▀▄  █        ██  ██ █    █   █    █
  █  █  █    █ █▄▄▄▄█  █  █  █ █▄ █        █ ██ █ █    █   █    █▄▄▄▄▄
  █▄▄█  █    █ █    █  █▄▄█  █  █ █  ▀▀▀   █ ▀▀ █ █    █   █    █
 █    █ █▄▄▄▀  █    █ █    █ █   ██        █    █ ▀▄▄▄▄▀   █    █▄▄▄▄▄</pre>

					<p class="arabic-line"><span class="crescent">☾</span> أَذَان &nbsp;·&nbsp; the call to prayer</p>

					<h1 class="hero-h1"><span class="tag">$</span> let the adhan through.</h1>

					<p class="sub">
						<span class="prompt-inline">&gt;</span> finds your local prayer times · quiets Spotify, YouTube, anything playing · for a few minutes at each prayer · hands your volume back.
						<br />
						<span class="prompt-inline">&gt;</span> no accounts. no cloud. one small process on your machine.
					</p>

					<div class="cta-row">
						<a class="cta" href="https://github.com/wailbentafat/adhan-mute/releases/latest">[ download latest release ]</a>
						<a class="cta ghost" href="#install">[ install with uv ]</a>
					</div>

					<div class="terminal">
						<div class="terminal-bar">
							<span class="dot red"></span>
							<span class="dot yellow"></span>
							<span class="dot green"></span>
							<span class="terminal-title">zsh — adhan-mute</span>
						</div>
						<pre class="terminal-body"><code><span class="p">$</span> adhan-mute
Detecting location...
Location: Algiers (36.7538, 3.0588)
Fetching today's prayer times...
Today's times: Fajr 05:15 · Dhuhr 12:44 · Asr 16:17 · Maghrib 18:59 · Isha 20:12
Next: Maghrib at 18:59 (in 42.0 min)
<span class="hl">&gt;&gt;&gt; Maghrib — muting for 5 min.</span>
Unmuted (restored volume to 35).<span class="blink">_</span></code></pre>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<div class="motif" aria-hidden="true">✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦</div>

			<section class="wrap panel" id="install">
				<h2><span class="tag">01</span> install</h2>
				<p class="note top">Prebuilt binaries need nothing installed — grab yours from the <a href="https://github.com/wailbentafat/adhan-mute/releases/latest">latest release</a> and run it.</p>
				<h3>&gt; from source, with uv</h3>
				<pre><code>git clone https://github.com/wailbentafat/adhan-mute
cd adhan-mute
uv sync
uv run main.py</code></pre>
				<p class="note">Requires <a href="https://docs.astral.sh/uv/">uv</a>. On Linux, also requires <code>alsa-utils</code> (usually preinstalled).</p>
			</section>

			<div class="motif" aria-hidden="true">✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦</div>

			<section class="wrap panel">
				<h2><span class="tag">02</span> how it works</h2>
				<ol>
					<li>Detects your approximate location via IP geolocation (no account, no permissions).</li>
					<li>Fetches today's five prayer times for that location from the Aladhan API.</li>
					<li>Waits until the next prayer time.</li>
					<li>Mutes system volume, waits a configurable number of minutes, then restores your previous volume.</li>
					<li>Repeats daily.</li>
				</ol>
			</section>

			<div class="motif" aria-hidden="true">✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦ ◆ ✦</div>

			<section class="wrap panel">
				<h2><span class="tag">03</span> options</h2>
				<pre><code>uv run main.py --mute-minutes 5 --poll-seconds 60</code></pre>
				<table>
					<tbody>
						<tr>
							<td><code>--mute-minutes</code></td>
							<td>How long to keep audio muted at each prayer time. Default: 5.</td>
						</tr>
						<tr>
							<td><code>--poll-seconds</code></td>
							<td>How often to check the clock while waiting. Default: 60.</td>
						</tr>
					</tbody>
				</table>
			</section>
		</main>

		<footer class="wrap">
			<p><span class="prompt-inline">&gt;</span> MIT-licensed. Source and issues on <a href="https://github.com/wailbentafat/adhan-mute">GitHub</a>.<span class="blink">_</span></p>
		</footer>

		<style>
			:root {
				--bg: #060a06;
				--panel: #0b120b;
				--fg: #c9f7c9;
				--dim: #5f8f5f;
				--border: #1c3b1c;
				--green: #39ff6a;
				--amber: #ffb000;
				--red: #ff5f56;
			}

			* { box-sizing: border-box; }

			html, body {
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
				background: var(--bg);
				color: var(--fg);
				font-family: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
				line-height: 1.7;
			}

			/* CRT effects */
			.scanlines {
				position: fixed;
				inset: 0;
				pointer-events: none;
				z-index: 2;
				background: repeating-linear-gradient(
					to bottom,
					rgba(0,0,0,0) 0px,
					rgba(0,0,0,0) 1px,
					rgba(0,0,0,0.18) 2px,
					rgba(0,0,0,0.18) 3px
				);
				mix-blend-mode: multiply;
			}
			.vignette {
				position: fixed;
				inset: 0;
				pointer-events: none;
				z-index: 1;
				background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(0,0,0,0) 55%, rgba(0,0,0,0.55) 100%);
			}

			.wrap {
				max-width: 860px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 0 1.5rem;
			}

			header {
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
				position: relative;
				z-index: 3;
			}
			header .wrap {
				display: flex;
				justify-content: space-between;
				align-items: center;
				padding-top: 1rem;
				padding-bottom: 1rem;
				max-width: 860px;
			}
			.brand {
				font-weight: 700;
				font-size: 0.95rem;
				color: var(--green);
			}
			.brand .prompt {
				color: var(--dim);
			}
			.cursor {
				animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
			}
			.blink {
				animation: blink 1s step-end infinite;
			}
			@keyframes blink {
				0%, 49% { opacity: 1; }
				50%, 100% { opacity: 0; }
			}

			.gh-link {
				color: var(--dim);
				text-decoration: none;
				font-size: 0.85rem;
			}
			.gh-link:hover {
				color: var(--green);
				text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(57,255,106,0.6);
			}

			/* Hero */
			.hero {
				position: relative;
				z-index: 3;
				background:
					radial-gradient(700px 400px at 20% -10%, rgba(57,255,106,0.08), transparent 60%),
					var(--bg);
			}
			.hero-inner {
				padding: 3rem 1.5rem 4rem;
			}

			.ascii {
				margin: 0 0 1.8rem;
				color: var(--green);
				font-size: 0.75rem;
				line-height: 1.2;
				white-space: pre;
				overflow-x: auto;
				text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(57,255,106,0.45);
			}
			@media (max-width: 700px) {
				.ascii { display: none; }
			}

			.hero-h1 {
				font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 3.4vw, 1.8rem);
				margin: 0 0 1.3rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				color: #eaffea;
				letter-spacing: -0.01em;
			}
			.tag {
				color: var(--amber);
			}

			.sub {
				color: var(--dim);
				font-size: 0.92rem;
				max-width: 620px;
				margin: 0 0 2rem;
			}
			.prompt-inline {
				color: var(--green);
			}

			.cta-row {
				display: flex;
				gap: 1rem;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
				margin-bottom: 2.4rem;
			}
			.cta {
				display: inline-block;
				padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
				text-decoration: none;
				font-size: 0.88rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				color: var(--bg);
				background: var(--green);
				border: 1px solid var(--green);
			}
			.cta:hover {
				background: #6bff92;
				box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(57,255,106,0.5);
			}
			.cta.ghost {
				background: transparent;
				color: var(--green);
			}
			.cta.ghost:hover {
				box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(57,255,106,0.35);
			}

			.terminal {
				border: 1px solid var(--border);
				background: #050805;
				box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(57,255,106,0.05), 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
			}
			.terminal-bar {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 0.4rem;
				padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem;
				background: #0d150d;
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
			}
			.dot {
				width: 9px;
				height: 9px;
				border-radius: 50%;
				opacity: 0.85;
			}
			.dot.red { background: var(--red); }
			.dot.yellow { background: var(--amber); }
			.dot.green { background: var(--green); }
			.terminal-title {
				margin-left: 0.6rem;
				font-size: 0.72rem;
				color: var(--dim);
			}
			.terminal-body {
				margin: 0;
				padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem 1.3rem;
				font-size: 0.78rem;
				line-height: 1.7;
				color: var(--fg);
				background: transparent;
				border: none;
				white-space: pre-wrap;
				word-break: break-word;
			}
			.terminal-body .p {
				color: var(--amber);
			}
			.terminal-body .hl {
				color: var(--green);
				text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(57,255,106,0.5);
			}

			/* Content panels */
			.panel {
				position: relative;
				z-index: 3;
				padding: 2.4rem 1.5rem;
			}

			.crescent {
				color: var(--amber);
				margin-right: 0.35rem;
			}

			.arabic-line {
				direction: rtl;
				unicode-bidi: isolate;
				display: inline-flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 0.4rem;
				font-family: "Traditional Arabic", "Geeza Pro", "Noto Naskh Arabic", serif;
				font-size: 1.1rem;
				color: var(--amber);
				margin: 0 0 1.4rem;
				direction: ltr;
			}
			.arabic-line .crescent {
				order: -1;
			}

			.motif {
				position: relative;
				z-index: 3;
				text-align: center;
				color: var(--border);
				font-size: 0.7rem;
				letter-spacing: 0.4rem;
				padding: 1.1rem 1rem;
				overflow: hidden;
				white-space: nowrap;
				user-select: none;
			}
			h2 {
				font-size: 1rem;
				margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				color: #eaffea;
				letter-spacing: 0.02em;
			}
			h3 {
				font-size: 0.85rem;
				margin: 1.6rem 0 0.8rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				color: var(--dim);
			}

			pre {
				background: var(--panel);
				border: 1px solid var(--border);
				padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
				overflow-x: auto;
				font-size: 0.82rem;
				line-height: 1.6;
				color: var(--fg);
			}
			code {
				font-family: "JetBrains Mono", ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
			}
			.note {
				color: var(--dim);
				font-size: 0.82rem;
				margin-top: 0.9rem;
			}
			.note.top {
				margin-top: 0;
				margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
			}

			ol {
				color: var(--fg);
				padding-left: 1.3rem;
				margin: 0;
				font-size: 0.9rem;
			}
			ol li {
				margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
			}
			ol li::marker {
				color: var(--green);
			}

			table {
				border-collapse: collapse;
				width: 100%;
				margin-top: 1.2rem;
				font-size: 0.85rem;
			}
			td {
				padding: 0.6rem 0.9rem 0.6rem 0;
				vertical-align: top;
				border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
				color: var(--fg);
			}
			td:first-child {
				white-space: nowrap;
				font-weight: 700;
				color: var(--amber);
			}

			a {
				color: var(--green);
			}

			footer {
				position: relative;
				z-index: 3;
				padding: 2rem 1.5rem 3rem;
				color: var(--dim);
				font-size: 0.8rem;
				border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
			}
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
